{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000027"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "belief", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "this is what I call a market split. So, let me show you the actual trajectory from the beginning of the market, how the prices behave", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000027"}], "text": "The Dubai real estate market experiences a 'market split,' where offline and secondary markets are affecting each other."}, "title": "Dubai Real Estate Market Split", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:knowledge:36f46b6866c62886", "metadata_hash": "52f8bbb86f8eb65edc4d786dec0f4a5f48fa99111f5fad5fc6cb904629abb7df", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Dubai Real Estate Market Split", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
