{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000048"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "what I'm trying to tell you here is again, I promise I'm not going to make any prediction, but I want you to understand that on the previous market, regardless of what was there, what was not there yet, it took us almost three years to drop forty percent in price.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000048"}], "text": "It took almost three years for the Dubai property market to drop 40% in price during a previous market downturn."}, "title": "Property Price Cycles in Dubai", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:knowledge:574d77b91c8896b9", "metadata_hash": "52f8bbb86f8eb65edc4d786dec0f4a5f48fa99111f5fad5fc6cb904629abb7df", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Property Price Cycles in Dubai", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000050"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "No, because of the payment plans that the developers are offering for many, specifically international investors, it's it's way more appealing to get the free two years, four years payment plan rather than try to get a mortgage or trying to get some sort of a cheaper unit on the secondary market.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000050"}], "text": "Payment plans for off-plan transactions are appealing to international investors, offering free two to four-year plans."}, "title": "Appeal of Off-plan Property Payment Plans", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:knowledge:c9a55d5f9545d356", "metadata_hash": "52f8bbb86f8eb65edc4d786dec0f4a5f48fa99111f5fad5fc6cb904629abb7df", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Appeal of Off-plan Property Payment Plans", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000029"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "illustration", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "on my training sessions, the agents that I trained. What had happened here in 2014? Why we actually moved so fast? And I would say we got an opportunity to host Expo 2020", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000029"}], "text": "During training sessions, agents are asked about the events in 2014 that led to Dubai's rapid market movement."}, "speaker_id": "1", "strategy": null, "title": "Agent Training Sessions", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:cases:d6ac08814ce9d5a5", "metadata_hash": "52f8bbb86f8eb65edc4d786dec0f4a5f48fa99111f5fad5fc6cb904629abb7df", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Agent Training Sessions", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000046"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "illustration", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "you can see the demand on the townhouses and villas increased significantly for the ready properties uh after Corona. You might not know that but those who've been stuck here through March till let's say almost end of June uh in twenty twenty they felt me includingly I was in in the smaller union back then that I want a space I want to be able to go my yard I I want this.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000046"}], "text": "Post-Corona, individuals began seeking larger living spaces in Dubai, driven by the desire for more personal space."}, "speaker_id": "1", "strategy": null, "title": "Demand for Larger Living Spaces Post-Corona", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:cases:52910bc9bc19a4a5", "metadata_hash": "52f8bbb86f8eb65edc4d786dec0f4a5f48fa99111f5fad5fc6cb904629abb7df", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Demand for Larger Living Spaces Post-Corona", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000048"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "it took us almost three years to drop forty percent in price. So if you're looking for the whole market to go down to to forty percent, that probably not going to happen within one or two or three or even or even twelve months altogether.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000048"}], "text": "The speaker reassures the audience by emphasizing that a significant market decline won't happen suddenly, citing historical data on the duration of market downturns."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Market Demand Explanation", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:expression:b6cafbb5e9874d62", "metadata_hash": "52f8bbb86f8eb65edc4d786dec0f4a5f48fa99111f5fad5fc6cb904629abb7df", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Market Demand Explanation", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000050"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "it's way more appealing to get the free two years, four years payment plan rather than try to get a mortgage or trying to get some sort of a cheaper unit on the secondary market.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000050"}], "text": "The speaker highlights the appeal of payment plans for off-plan properties to international investors, contrasting them with the challenges of securing mortgages or secondary market properties."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Appeal to International Investors", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:expression:6050f319b471ff83", "metadata_hash": "52f8bbb86f8eb65edc4d786dec0f4a5f48fa99111f5fad5fc6cb904629abb7df", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Appeal to International Investors", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000053"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "if the evaluation is coming from the bank with a lower price, most probably your seller will be half to much the price of the bank. That's not the case in Dubai.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000053"}], "text": "A bank's evaluation of a property's price in Dubai does not necessarily affect the seller's asking price, unlike in some other countries where sellers might match the bank's evaluation."}, "title": "property evaluation practices", "topic": "Dubai property market"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:knowledge:6e8772b0123ae98f", "metadata_hash": "52f8bbb86f8eb65edc4d786dec0f4a5f48fa99111f5fad5fc6cb904629abb7df", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "property evaluation practices", "topic": "Dubai property market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000054"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "price, yeah, it might be lower than the bank thinks, but I still want this price. And believe me, a lot of buyers will still go ahead because the properties, um the good ones are on a high demand always.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000054"}], "text": "Despite lower evaluations from banks, many buyers in Dubai may still proceed with purchasing properties due to high demand for good ones."}, "title": "demand for properties", "topic": "Dubai property market"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:knowledge:9750ad7ef648d975", "metadata_hash": "52f8bbb86f8eb65edc4d786dec0f4a5f48fa99111f5fad5fc6cb904629abb7df", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "demand for properties", "topic": "Dubai property market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
